Completed the selected item-7 non-UI sprint: the Supabase month-advance processing store now applies processed pending TARA target weights to durable `asset_holdings` before marking orders processed.

Changed:
- `app/infrastructure/inngest/month-advance-supabase-store.ts:136`
  - Re-reads matching pending current-month `tara_orders` during persistence.
  - Parses and validates class/month scope.
  - Updates Base/Core/Apex `asset_holdings` via `writeAssetHoldingTargetWeights` before `tara_orders.status = processed`.
  - Keeps sanitized provider failure messages, including `asset_holdings`.
- `app/infrastructure/inngest/month-advance-supabase-store.test.ts:256`
  - Added expectations for per-tier holding rebalance updates.
  - Added sanitized holding-write failure coverage.
